<!-- ── ABOUT OVERVIEW ────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">
            <div class="section-label-line"></div>
            <span>The Consultancy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-2">
            <div class="reveal">
                <h2 class="ov-subheading">
                    We don’t just build <em>software</em>.<br />We solve <em>operational problems</em> with engineering.
                </h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="ov-text reveal">
                    Gilbert Specialists Tech is a specialized .NET and cloud engineering consultancy based in 
                    Nairobi, Kenya, serving clients across international markets.
                </p>
                <p class="ov-text reveal reveal-d1">
                    We help startups, software companies, and enterprise teams build modern web 
                    applications, migrate legacy systems, improve performance, and deliver cleaner digital 
                    workflows using the Microsoft technology stack.
                </p>
                <p class="ov-text reveal reveal-d2">
                    As a registered, technical consultancy, we operate with the structural transparency and strict cross-border compliance that international procurement requires. We are fully equipped for frictionless, compliant vendor onboarding - including IRS Form <strong>W-8BEN</strong> processing for US entities and international independent contractor frameworks that eliminate global labor misclassification risks. Every engagement is architected for seamless integration, elite technical execution, and measurable business impact.
                </p>
                <p class="ov-text reveal reveal-d2">
                    For international clients, we operate as a professional remote
                    technology partner with clear communication, structured delivery, and contract-ready engagement models.
                </p>
                <div class="ov-cta-row reveal">
                    <a href="/about" class="btn-secondary">
                        <span>Learn more about us</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── SERVICES OVERVIEW ──────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">
            <div class="section-label-line"></div>
            <span>Capabilities</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-2 mb-60">
            <div class="reveal">
                <h2 class="ov-heading">What<br />We Build.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="reveal reveal-d1 self-end">
                <p class="ov-text">Focused engineering across the .NET ecosystem; from modern Blazor frontends to scalable backend systems, cloud deployments, and legacy modernization.</p>
                <div class="ov-cta-row">
                    <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">
                        <span>View all capabilities</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-3">
            <div class="mini-card reveal">
                <span class="mc-num">01</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">◈</div>
                <div class="mc-title">Blazor Web Application Development</div>
                <div class="mc-text">We design and build modern Blazor applications using WebAssembly, 
                    Server, and the unified Blazor Web App model.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    Whether you need a customer portal, internal dashboard, SaaS interface, or enterprise workflow system, we 
                    build applications that are fast, maintainable, and ready for real users.
                </div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card reveal reveal-d1">
                <span class="mc-num">02</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">⬡</div>
                <div class="mc-title">Azure Cloud Architecture</div>
                <div class="mc-text">Cost-optimized, resilient cloud systems built for enterprise scale from Static Web Apps to microservices.</div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
             <div class="mini-card reveal reveal-d2">
                <span class="mc-num">03</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">⌬</div>
                <div class="mc-title">AWS Cloud Architecture</div>
                <div class="mc-text">
                    Scalable AWS environments designed for secure hosting, storage, networking,
                    deployment, and cost-efficient cloud operations.
                </div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card reveal">
                <span class="mc-num">04</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">◎</div>
                <div class="mc-title">Legacy System Modernization</div>
                <div class="mc-text">
                    We migrate outdated systems into modern .NET and Blazor architectures without disrupting 
                    business operations.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    This includes moving from WPF, React, older .NET applications, manual 
                    workflows, and fragmented systems into cleaner, web-based platforms that are easier to maintain and scale.</div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

